        "id": 1305927
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-10-29T15:31:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I suggested this. I found the previous structure of this function to be hard to follow, and I thought that having distinct blocks for 1) figuring out which component to use and getting its measurement and 2) interpreting that measurement would be clearer. But I\u0027m fine with deferring this until right before it\u0027s used.",
      "parentUuid": "6dad5163_1dbaf14c",
      "revId": "b67e6978ae5e06f8359bd375dfb99a7b43e2b8a6",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
